    <description>Soumet automatiquement un Purchase_Price__c a l&apos;Approval Process quand le statut passe a To Confirm (create ou update, y compris revisions wizard avec PP_Revises__c). Ne re-soumet pas si le statut reste To Confirm sans changement, ni si une approbation est deja Pending.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fxAppendApprovalQuotationSegment</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
ISBLANK({!varApprovalClientsSummary}),
&quot;&quot;,
&quot;; &quot;
) &amp; IF(
ISBLANK({!Loop_Approval_Quotations.Approval_Customer_Name__c}),
&quot;Client inconnu&quot;,
{!Loop_Approval_Quotations.Approval_Customer_Name__c}
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fxApprovalContextSpecific</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
NOT(ISBLANK($Record.PP_Revises__c)),
&quot;Price Update | Customer-Specific Price | Clients: &quot; &amp; IF(ISBLANK({!varApprovalClientsSummary}), &quot;(none)&quot;, {!varApprovalClientsSummary}),
&quot;Customer-Specific Price | Clients: &quot; &amp; IF(ISBLANK({!varApprovalClientsSummary}), &quot;(none)&quot;, {!varApprovalClientsSummary})
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fxApprovalContextStandard</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
NOT(ISBLANK($Record.PP_Revises__c)),
&quot;Price Update | Standard Price&quot;,
&quot;Standard Price&quot;
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fxNoPendingApproval</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>ISBLANK({!Get_Pending_Approval_Instance.Id})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fxShouldAutoSubmit</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>AND(
TEXT($Record.Status__c) = &quot;To Confirm&quot;,
OR(
ISNEW(),
ISCHANGED($Record.Status__c)
)
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>PP_PurchasePrice_AfterSave_AutoSubmitApproval {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
